  Example with nearest interpolation:

  >>> image = np.arange(0, 18, 2).astype('float32').reshape(3, 3)
  >>> result = tf.image.crop_and_resize(
  ...   image[None, :, :, None],
  ...   np.asarray([[0.5,0.5,1,1]]), [0], [3, 3], method='nearest')
  >>> result[0][:, :, 0]
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(3, 3), dtype=float32, numpy=
